  "summary": { "en": [ "2 play areas in Hawthorn Park (UBC). North: spring riders, a spring seesaw and a small slide tower. South: a metal climbing frame with a slide, a bowl-shaped spinning seat and a standing spinner. Not in the City of Vancouver open data; the position is where the survey photos were taken." ], "ja": [ "Hawthorn Park（UBC）にある遊び場 2 か所。北側にスプリング遊具、ばねのシーソー、小さなすべり台の塔。南側にすべり台の付いた金属の登り枠、おわん形の回る椅子、立って回る遊具。市のオープンデータには無く、位置は現地調査の写真を撮った地点。" ] },
